# type(scope): subject   (<=72 chars, imperative mood, no trailing period)
#
# type must be one of: feat fix refactor test docs chore perf build ci
# scope is optional -- the area touched, e.g. profile, workouts, migrations,
# healthkit, sport-goals.
#
# --- Body (optional) ---
# Explain *why*, not just what the diff already shows. Wrap around 72 cols.
#
# --- Footer (optional) ---
# Breaking-change notes, issue references, Co-Authored-By trailers.
#
# --- Examples ---
#   feat(sport-goals): add re-test flow to GoalHubView
#   fix(healthkit): stop double-counting overlapping sleep sources
#   docs: add deployment runbook
#   chore(migrations): re-apply two shadowed migrations
#   refactor(supabase-client): split into per-domain extensions
#
# Enforced by .git/hooks/commit-msg -- run scripts/install-hooks.sh once per
# clone to install it. Bypass for one commit (use sparingly):
#   git commit --no-verify
